  "_comment": "Google Tasks API v1. Two calls: tasklists.list then tasks.list per list. https://developers.google.com/tasks/reference/rest . THE QUIRK THAT MATTERS: `due` is RFC3339 with a time component, but Google Tasks has NO concept of a due TIME -- the time is always 00:00:00.000Z and is meaningless. Only the date part may be used. `status` is needsAction|completed, and completed tasks are omitted entirely unless showCompleted=true. A task may have no `due` at all.",
